{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104327","id":2401890204,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PKe-c","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104327","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104327.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104327.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104327","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104327/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104327/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104327/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8c7a64ac495087f5f9c765df7604692b324b3af9","number":104327,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Deprecate `CanvasItem::get_viewport_transform`","user":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Implement part of https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4250\r\nImplement https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93735#discussion_r2001192903\r\n\r\nThe usability of this function is very disputable.\r\n\r\n1. Based on its [incomprehensible documentation](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93735#discussion_r1659815486) it is likely that this functions intention is not widely understood or used\r\n2. In order to understand the functionality, not only [basic knowledge](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/2d/2d_transforms.html) about transforms is necessary, but also [detailed internal knowledge](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/core_and_modules/2d_coordinate_systems.html) about the engine is necessary. So this function should not have been exposed to the API in my personal opinion.\r\n3. In order to [streamline access to transform2d](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4250), the current functionality should be removed.\r\n4. The functionality of the function can be easily replicated in GDScript by accessing the canvas transform and the viewports final transform.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","label